  "description": "Chemical Mechanical Planarization using colloidal silica or alumina abrasive slurries with polyurethane pads to achieve nanometer-scale surface flatness. Enables multi-level metal interconnect by planarizing dielectric layers between metallization steps. Removal rates 100-300 nm/min for oxide CMP, 200-400 nm/min for tungsten CMP.",
